step Light Armor Kit to 51
  tip Light Armor Kit is orange at 20 (yellow 30, green 45, grey 60): about 45 crafts to 51, up to 53 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Light Leather. Use the 19 Light Leather you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One Light Leather a craft; the kits sell to vendors.
  craft 2152 until 51

