  tip Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Embossed Leather Gloves (from 40, 1s 50c). Also learn Camp Tent (1s): Forever's Leatherworking camp item, 5 Light Leather, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. The Camping 101: Leatherworking quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a leatherworking trainer who teaches it free.
