# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert (150-225)
section Leatherworking 150-225

step Leatherworking 150-225: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 29 Fine Thread (29s), 15 Salt (7s 50c) and 145 Silken Thread (7g 25s); about 7g 61s 50c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby and Jillian Tanner; Orgrimmar: Felika, Shimra and Tamar).
