step Expert Leatherworking
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225; it needs Leatherworking 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Telonis (Darnassus); Horde Una (Thunder Bluff). This route trains it at Telonis (Darnassus) for the Alliance and Una (Thunder Bluff) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 150-225: one trainer for every visit. Learn now: Barbaric Shoulders (from 150). 150-225 takes about 7g 61s 50c of vendor goods, plus 398 Thick Leather to gather or buy. The gathering steps below come between the visits: learn each recipe when you are back for it. Nightscape Pants (from 205) takes a second trip, to other trainers (below).
  level 20
  train Leatherworking Expert npc 4212 only Alliance
  train Leatherworking Expert npc 3007 only Horde
  learn 7151 npc 4212 only Alliance
  learn 7151 npc 3007 only Horde

